


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_626d2bbc:


    "周六的午后。宿舍里只有伦和阳菜两个人。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_4f4606a7:



    voice "2RI_1134"
    rin "「唔……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_782cfa43:


    "慵懒地侧躺着看电视的伦在不停地切换频道，当她看到一个综艺节目的重播时就没继续换台了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_927254ee:


    "画面上显示的是十来个女生在有小雪飘舞的天气下闹腾着，而她们身上只穿着比基尼。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_7d62d46e:



    voice "2RI_1135"
    rin "「比基尼啊……真要命呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_63dd66f2:


    "在这寒冬时节里穿比基尼……"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_e4e2c329:


    "看来是节目中的一个环节。是不是因为她们都是写真女郎的缘故呢，感觉好像都脱习惯了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_63c0727b:


    "而当女孩们走进了小树丛后，发现那里有露天温泉。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_5fcb7795:



    voice "2RI_1136"
    rin "「诶～好奇怪的温泉」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_8ce4fa66:


    "热腾腾的温泉有几个下水道口那么大，而这些女孩则是一个接一个地各自挑选好泉口并泡了进去。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_0c6e1bca:


    "她们在冒着蒸汽的温泉面前闹腾得不行。毕竟想让暴露在凛冽寒风中那被冻僵的身体尽早暖和起来也是理所当然的事。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_e1b453af:


    "不过从画面上的字幕来看似乎这些温泉之中有些泉口的水温是非常烫的。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_fc8380a4:



    voice "2RI_1137"
    rin "「原来如此。变成了俄罗斯轮盘了吗……忽冷忽热的看起来好像会裂开来呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_3fa5be56:



    voice "2HI_1097"
    hina "「我说你啊。对着电视碎碎念的简直像个大叔一样哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_7a2fcdbd:


    "从厨房里传出了阳菜唏嘘的声音。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_4d1b9125:



    voice "2RI_1138"
    rin "「诶，我发出声音了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_804e579f:



    voice "2HI_1098"
    hina "「是啊。我在厨房这边都听到了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_eea603ed:



    voice "2RI_1139"
    rin "「嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_4dcf2e82:



    voice "2RI_1140"
    rin "「你在热什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_64b53996:



    voice "2HI_1099"
    hina "「我在热浅生她之前准备好的吃的。伦你要吃红薯蛋糕吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_c2b5291d:



    voice "2RI_1141"
    rin "「如果是文做的点心那我肯定要吃～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_bcab5228:



    voice "2HI_1100"
    hina "「好吧好吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_642040bc:


    "阳菜在碟子上放了两把叉子。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_6b709e1a:



    voice "2HI_1101"
    hina "「我说，你别躺着吃东西啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_b0dcb34d:



    voice "2RI_1142"
    rin "「好吧好吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_b9c85a94:


    "伦慢吞吞地坐了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_fcf90425:



    voice "2HI_1102"
    hina "「明明还大白天的这节目内容露出度真高啊。会不会有人去投诉呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_0a3956c8:


    "这是阳菜进客厅看到电视后的第一句感想。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_f342faa0:



    voice "2RI_1143"
    rin "「像那样什么都要投诉的话那这个世界会变得很无聊吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_f1115bc4:



    voice "2HI_1103"
    hina "「没，我也是觉得各种节目要丰富多彩才好啊。只是感觉最近很少在白天见到有泳装的节目了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_961df7ce:



    voice "2RI_1144"
    rin "「不能播有穿泳装的女生的节目那会不会有点奇怪啊？不就是可爱而已吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_29a30760:



    voice "2HI_1104"
    hina "「该说是把性给商品化了吗？详细的我倒是不清楚了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_3c1bf042:



    voice "2RI_1145"
    rin "「如果商品化了那只要拿来卖不就行了吗？不仅是用来看的，像是脑袋聪明的或是唱歌好听的全都可以。大家把自己所擅长的东西给商品化了然后出售就是了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_92da2adf:



    voice "2RI_1145a"
    rin "「啊，当然必须得基于自愿的原则才可以哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_daac2011:



    voice "2RI_1146"
    rin "「综上所述阳菜也去出售自己那体力吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_8a28abc2:



    voice "2HI_1105"
    hina "「虽然知道你这逻辑没问题但就是觉得火大」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_697a9780:



    voice "2RI_1147"
    rin "「啊，果然明白了吗？阳菜好聪明呀～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_3bee7824:



    voice "2HI_1106"
    hina "「烦死了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_3e8935fb:


    "阳菜和伦在暖和的房间里一边用单手拿叉戳点心来吃一边看着那些女生们相继挑战俄罗斯轮盘温泉的节目。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_71ef5f28:



    voice "2RI_1148"
    rin "「果然在这个时代不会有走光福利了吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_e6eea998:



    voice "2HI_1107"
    hina "「毕竟是白天的普通电视台播的嘛。啊，你看这女生是不是挺可爱的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_9377009c:


    "阳菜指了指画面里的其中一个女生。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_a0533a5b:



    voice "2RI_1149"
    rin "「穿橙色泳装的那个？确实还算不错的。只不过嘛，还是文比较可爱」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_f0294fd4:



    voice "2HI_1108"
    hina "「说的是呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_1b756304:


    "已经习惯了秀恩爱的阳菜只是随便附和了一下。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_8a891d31:



    voice "2HI_1109"
    hina "「后面那个穿蓝白条纹的呢？就胸部很大的那个，不就是你的菜么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_bda5be0f:



    voice "2RI_1150"
    rin "「你不懂啊。并不是说胸部大就好的。形状和坚挺度，还有和脸蛋之间的反差……在那方面，文的胸部可是全部满分，简直是世界的至宝啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_f8682cc4:



    voice "2HI_1110"
    hina "「真是厉害诶。浅生面对这些偶像完全就所向披靡了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_63926490:



    voice "2RI_1151"
    rin "「您注意到了吗？比偶像还要可爱的普通人？千年一遇的奇迹般的普通？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_9529f512:



    voice "2HI_1111"
    hina "「终于开始说胡话了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_ec389768:



    voice "2RI_1152"
    rin "「然后，至于能和那位超·偶像级的美少女交往的幸福的人，跟我一起说出她的名字！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_912c13ba:


    hina_rin "「绪方伦小姐——！」\n「…………」" (what_rest_indent=0)


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_e652e6cd:



    voice "2RI_1154"
    rin "「跟上来啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_a9388f1f:



    voice "2HI_1113"
    hina "「我才不要！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_9319ee83:



    voice "2RI_1155"
    rin "「不过要说文最让人心醉的地方嘛——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_a5722857:



    voice "2HI_1114"
    hina "「……你还要继续说嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_1fdd8975:



    voice "2RI_1156"
    rin "「那就是性格实在是太棒了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_9e3e4ea0:



    voice "2HI_1115"
    hina "「啊～那个我倒是有深彻的感悟啊。毕竟正因为是浅生所以才能和伦交往」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_da71403e:



    voice "2RI_1157"
    rin "「哈？你这话是什么意思？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_62696500:



    voice "2HI_1116"
    hina "「我的话多半是每天都要踹飞你了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_b0ead5d5:


    "呵呵。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_cedf1f13:



    voice "2RI_1158"
    rin "「非常抱歉！请容许我拒绝和你的交往！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_8e1f8399:



    voice "2HI_1117"
    hina "「没说想和你交往！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_b663d3ce:



    voice "2HI_1118"
    hina "「我说真的，你得考虑好今后的人生来跟她交往哦？要是哪天你因为只知道撒娇结果被嫌弃了我可不管你哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_9115ee6b:



    voice "2RI_1159"
    rin "「不会嫌弃的啦～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_5758ec8e:



    voice "2HI_1119"
    hina "「你那自信是哪来的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_6e1c915a:



    voice "2RI_1160"
    rin "「因为将来我要嫁入她们家啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou3_03_f0e8320d:



    voice "2HI_1120"
    hina "「那不就是个蹭饭吃的吗！」"
